    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>History awaits your command.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Samurai Conqueror</strong> is an epic historical strategy game where you aim to unify Japan across time \u2014 from the ancient Kofun period to the transformative Meiji era.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set against the vast sweep of Japanese history, you\u2019ll choose a legendary figure to lead your faction and reshape the course of the nation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Develop your domain through commerce, farming, culture, and military strength.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wage war, expand your territory, and rise as the one who unifies the ages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>Lead a Legend</strong> \u2013 Choose one historical figure from Japanese history to guide your faction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>Build Your Power</strong> \u2013 Strengthen commerce, farming, culture, and military through strategic development.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>Rewrite History</strong> \u2013 Invade rival factions and expand your realm in the struggle to unify Japan across time.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>History awaits your command.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Samurai Conqueror</strong> is an epic historical strategy game where you aim to unify Japan across time \u2014 from the ancient Kofun period to the transformative Meiji era.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set against the vast sweep of Japanese history, you\u2019ll choose a legendary figure to lead your faction and reshape the course of the nation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Develop your domain through commerce, farming, culture, and military strength.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wage war, expand your territory, and rise as the one who unifies the ages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>Lead a Legend</strong> \u2013 Choose one historical figure from Japanese history to guide your faction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>Build Your Power</strong> \u2013 Strengthen commerce, farming, culture, and military through strategic development.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>Rewrite History</strong> \u2013 Invade rival factions and expand your realm in the struggle to unify Japan across time.</p>",
